#AREA Ogre Den~
#AUTHORS Jaxom  ~

#AUTHORS Jaxom Robinton~



#HELPS
-1 OGRE 'OGRE DEN'~
{070}OGRE DEN
--------

The ogres of Ogre Den have taken up residence in a complex of caverns near
the halfling village of The Shire.  They have found that halfling stew makes
a good meal, but most of the time they just eat the halflings raw.

(a) {060}Jaxom{300}



{a}JAXOM
~
0 $~



#RANGES 5 35 1 50
#MOBILES
#2850
ogre metalworker~
the Ogre Metalworker~
An ogre with blackened skin stands here.
~
{070}He is a huge ogre with extraordinarily large muscles and skin that is
blackened by ash and soot.
~
ACT_RACE|ACT_BODY|ACT_SMART|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_SENTINEL
0 
-500 S
10 BODY_FOOT BODY_HAND|BODY_HEAD 1d1+1000 1d1+100
10 RACE_OGRE
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
if race($n) == 7
  mpechoat $n The ogre grunts at you in recognition.
  mpechoaround $n The ogre grunts as it sees $n.
else
  if race($n) == 1
    growl $n
    mpkill $n
  else
    if quest(2, 2, $n) == 1
      growl $n
      mpkill $n
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>all_greet_prog 0~
if class($n) == 6
  if quest(30, 1, $n) == 0
    shout I have banished a filthy assassin!
    mpmset $n quest 30 1 1
  else
    mptransfer $n 2899
    mpat $n mpforce $n say I am a loser!
    shout I have sent a backstabbing assassin to hell!
  endif
endif
~
|
#2851
ogre shaman~
the Ogre Shaman~
An ogre with painted skin chants here.~
{070}She is a small ogre with a gruesome face and skin that is
painted with ash and soot and she looks disgusting.
~
